# in.connector - generated by SetupData, edit the numbers only.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored by every reader.
# The values are read IN ORDER, so do not reorder or delete any of them.
# 1. inversion type: 1 = layer-cake, 2 = B-spline
1
# 2. gaussian width the OBSERVED receiver functions were computed with
3.0
# 3. number of jumps (tt)
12
# 4. models per jump (jt)
10000
# 5. number of cores / OpenMP threads
1
# 6. posterior selection style: -1 = percentage, 1 = absolute (min misfit + value)
-1
# 7. selection threshold: percent if style -1, misfit offset if style 1
10
# 8. depth step (km) for averaging the final model
0.05
# 9. output model plot style: 0 = layer-cake, 1 = gradient
1
# 10. model quality control: 1 = use CALmodel.C/goodmodel, 0 = free walk
1
# 11. higher mode: 1 = use {sta}.hph when present, 0 = FORCE OFF everywhere
1
# 12. higher-mode weight in the misfit (used only when the line above is 1)
1.0
